e: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\"><br \/>\r\n\t\t<\/h3>\r\n<h3 color:#191b1f;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1.1em; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">二、化学特性\r\n\t<\/h3>\r\n<ul font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(25,=\"\" 27,=\"\" 31);\"=\"\">\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t结构特点：mPEG-CM具有PEG链和羧甲基(COOH)基团，两者之间通过亚甲基(CH2)键连接。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t反应活性：mPEG-CM的羧基可以与羟基发生酯化反应形成酯键，也可以与氨基发生亲和取代反应形成酰胺。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t溶解性：mPEG-CM具有良好的亲水性和溶解性，能够溶于水和部分有机溶剂。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<h3 color:#191b1f;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1.1em; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\"><br \/>\r\n\t<\/h3>\r\n<h3 color:#191b1f;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1.1em; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">三、物理性质\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<ul font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(25,=\"\" 27,=\"\" 31);\"=\"\">\r\n<li>\r\n\t外观颜色：根据分子量的不同，mPEG-CM可能呈现固体或黏稠液体的形态。\r\n<\/li>\r\n<li>\r\n\t分子量：mPEG-CM的分子量有多种规格，如1000、2000、3400、5000、10000、20000等，且可根据需求定制。\r\n<\/li>\r\n\t<\/ul>\r\n<h3 color:#191b1f;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1.1em; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\"><br \/>\r\n\t\t<\/h3>\r\n<h3 color:#191b1f;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1.1em; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\">四、应用领域\r\n\t<\/h3>\r\n<ol font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 